# VM-A reverse proxy. Caddy auto-provisions Let's Encrypt TLS for the domain —
# using nip.io (free wildcard DNS: <anything>.104-43-112-6.nip.io resolves to
# 104.43.112.6) since there's no purchased domain for VM-A yet.
#
# Fronts bot-service directly — Recall loads /bot-page and posts /recall-webhook
# at the root, so everything just passes straight through (no path rewriting,
# unlike VM-B's /conf-api and /org-api prefixes).

bot.104-43-112-6.nip.io {
	reverse_proxy bot-service:8000
}
